    "title_en": "Conceptual design of a mid-energy spin rotator for continuous-wave operation based on a compact multi-pi rosetta magnet",
    "abstract_en": "Spin-rotators in the the few-MeV range require large trajectory deflection angles in order to change the spin direction appreciably. We describe a magnet system that accumulates adequately large bending angles in a small footprint and, at the same time, supports continuous-wave operation.",
